<section class="section section--flush page-hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Process Automation</h1></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><div class="section-promo__layout section-promo__layout--lead"><figure><img src="/assets/img/2024/08/10/process_automation.jpg" alt="Process automation control system" width="635" height="505" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Process automation control system</figcaption></figure><div class="section-promo__text"><h3>Industrial Automation Services: Comprehensive Solutions for Growth and Efficiency</h3><p>In the ever-evolving landscape of industrial automation, business income, whether satisfactory or not, demands continuous evaluation and strategic growth. Our company is at the forefront of driving such growth, offering a complete suite of services aimed at optimizing and enhancing existing products for new markets.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Comprehensive Services in Industrial Automation</h2>
<h3>From Conception to Commissioning</h3>
<p>We provide end-to-end services in the industrial automation sector, from the initial design phase through installation and commissioning, right down to personal training. Quality is our hallmark, and we extend maintenance services for the entire lifespan of the equipment.</p>
<p>### Diverse Project Implementation</p>
<p>Our expertise spans across optimization, rehabilitation, and the implementation of fully automated new projects across various industrial fields.</p>
<h3>Consulting Services</h3>
<p>We offer detailed informative documents and specialized technical consultancy to assist users of our proposed equipment. Our technical consulting services cover:</p>
<ul>
<li>Creation of new projects</li>
<li>Upgrading existing installations</li>
<li>Increasing productivity</li>
<li>Reducing maintenance and operating costs</li>
</ul>
<div class="grid grid--2 point-grid">
<div><h3>Customized Design Solutions</h3><p>Understanding that each business has unique needs, we customize applications to align perfectly with the desired business model. Our team oversees the entire process and project implementation, ensuring precision and quality. We provide all necessary documentation upon project completion.</p></div>
<div><h3>Turnkey Project Execution</h3><p>With nearly two decades of experience in industrial fields, we specialize in executing turnkey projects with a focus on:</p></div>
</div>
<ul>
<li>Technical coordination by an experienced team</li>
<li>Use of highest quality materials</li>
<li>Compliance with beneficiary requirements</li>
<li>Adherence to reference norms and specific project needs</li>
</ul>
<div class="grid grid--2 point-grid">
<div><h3>As Built Documentation</h3><p>Throughout project development and commissioning, we update the database to reflect on-site realities, accommodating changes such as additional requirements or unforeseen situations.</p></div>
<div><h3>Detailed Commissioning Process</h3><p>Our commissioning process includes:</p></div>
</div>
<ul>
<li>Site preparation</li>
<li>Execution of cable trays</li>
<li>Installation of equipment</li>
<li>Electrical connections</li>
<li>Implementation of tuning and control algorithms</li>
<li>Tests and commissioning</li>
</ul>
<div class="grid grid--2 point-grid">
<div><h3>Control system integrity and cyber security</h3><p>Control system assets are kept at vendor-supported release level and protected against internal and external threats as part of the maintenance scope. This covers lifecycle updates, patch and release management, and a backup regime that allows a control system to be restored quickly and the plant to keep running after a failure.</p></div>
<div><h3>Personal Training Programs</h3><p>We offer comprehensive training programs to ensure optimal functioning of your business. Trained employees will be adept at managing the computer control system, with in-depth knowledge of the assembled products and new projects implemented. Our training aims to equip employees with a thorough understanding of technological products, maintenance plans, and operational characteristics.</p></div>
<div><h3>Ongoing Maintenance Support</h3><p>Our commitment extends beyond project delivery. We offer preventive planned maintenance services to prevent repairs and control costs associated with equipment failures. Our specialized technical personnel establish maintenance schedules, coordinate, and verify the conformity of maintenance works, ensuring continuous operation and preventing unforeseen expenses.</p></div>
</div></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><h3>Our Services</h3>
